<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs-Friday est 105,000- USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs-Friday est 105,000- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts 1.00 lower than mid-session Thursday. Trade slow to moderate for light demand and offerings. Friday's estimate: 105000  Wk ago:103000 Yr ago: 104000 Saturday's  estimate: 15000 Wk ago:19000 Yr ago: 24000</p>
<p>Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs.</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>			   Country		    Plants</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    51.50 -52.50	   52.50 -53.50</p>
<p>few			51.00 -53.00	   54.00</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>260-280 lbs	    49.50 -52.50	   50.00 -53.50</p>
<p>US 2-4   43-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>280-300 lbs	    46.00 -51.00	   46.50 -52.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 3.00 higher.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   46.00 -48.00	   47.00 -49.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    47.00 -53.00	   47.00 -54.00</p>
<p>Compared to last week: Barrows and Gilts 4.00-4.50 lower. Sows steady to 4.00 higher.</p>
<p>Receipts this week 559,000 last week 557,000, last year 545,000.</p>
<p>Barrows and Gilts average weight for week ending Dec 7, 1996 255.1 lbs compared to 255.4 lbs previous week 252.6 lbs last year.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
